Z||000006||fierodave||08-28-2001||04:52 AM||||007 Dougs GT sail window replacements.....As always  the fit & finish is top notch!  I think this is the 10th set I have installed  from Doug!<BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=101570&a=13666063&p=53454474&Sequence=3&res=high"> <P>For the Money  I wouldn't install NOS Sails again from the dealer! after all the hassel of returning 5 sets to the dealer!  I could not even imagine ordering them from a another source sight unseen unless there was a very good return policy! and you were in no rush to get them!<BR>unless it was for a very very low original mile trailer queen car  for that perfect resto that time didn't matter.<BR>Great Job Doug!<BR>FD||||reg||1
