Z||000009||fierodave||08-28-2001||07:05 PM||||Yes  it was sanded,primed,sealed and painted!  Just replaceing the panels would not be as much fun!  :~)<BR>The owner saw it at 8Am this morning<BR>and about dropped his jaw lol!<BR>he couldn't help me load his 88 GT fast enough to bring it back here to get done also!    <P>I will also be dragging back his Blue 87 GT with 14k original miles and his 7k original silver GT  <BR>All of  them he purchased fron me.   This way I know they will all be back on the road soon :~)   Nice to see them come back from the ashes like this!  <BR>Well .........off to start tearing into the Med Red met 88 GT<BR>FD||||reg||1
